title: 종강총회_서은표_영문
---
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Wow, {name()}, you actually collected all the tickets?
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: That's amazing. So, are we really going into the Haunted House...?
{name()}: I'm a bit scared too... Should we just ride something else?
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: I'm scared as well, but...
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: I feel like if I'm with {name()}, it might be okay...
{name()}: I guess if we don't go now, we never will...
{name()}: Alright then, let's go while we still have the nerve.
(Guided by the staff, we entered the Haunted House.)
Staff: Watch your step, and please follow the arrows on the floor~
(It's pitch black inside; I can't see a thing.)
{name()}: Ugh... I can't see anything.
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: Eek!!!!!!
(EunPyo, who was standing behind me, screamed and buried her face in my shoulder.)
(Suddenly, a prop of a severed hand dropped from above.)
{name()}: G-gah!!!
(EunPyo's hands are gripping my shoulders tight.)
(she seems completely terrified.)
(Determined to keep my head straight, I took one step at a time.)
<<show pyo_neg2>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: (With a tearful voice) I... I can't open my eyes...
{name()}: There's nothing in front of us right now, but...
{name()}: ...Just trust me and follow me!! 
(A sudden surge of responsibility made me raise my voice.)
(We faced many scares with every step...)
(And we moved forward, stuck closely together...)
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: {name()}, thanks for leading the way...
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: It's so much better because I'm with you...
{name()}: It's nothing... Are you that scared?
{name()}: (Gosh... when is this going to end...)
(The Haunted House felt endless.)
(Just as I let my guard down, wondering when the exit would appear—)
{name()}: AAAAGH!!!!!!!
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: AAAHHH~~~!!!!
(A staff member dressed as a ghost suddenly jumped out with a scream.)
(Instinctively, I spun around.)
(And then, I made eye contact with EunPyo.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: (With a deadpan expression) Aaah~~~ {name()}, I'm so scared!!!
EunPyo: Oops.
{name()}: ......
(How awkward......)
Staff dressed as a ghost: ......
EunPyo: *Ahem.*
(EunPyo tried to ignore the gaze and turned me back around to face forward.)
(Then she buried her face in my shoulder again.)
(I feel like I've been played, but since we need to get out of here first—)
The staff member, sensing the vibe: ...... KYYAAAAGH!!!!
{name()}: Waaaaagh!!!!
<<show pyo_shock>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: G-go away~~~!!!!
(Fortunately, the exit wasn't far.)
(After running out of the exit, looking at ourselves in the bright light was hilarious.)
{name()}: ...You, I knew it. You tricked me.
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Tricked you? What do you mean?
(EunPyo looks incredibly happy.)
EunPyo: {name()}, you were so reliable and brave.
EunPyo: I love being with you~~~ Thanks, {name()}.
{name()}: Fine, as long as you had fun...
EunPyo: Let's take a picture.
<<print "Give me a V. Say cheese~" EunPyo>>
<<cheese 종강총회_서은표2_영문>>
===

